@startuml
title VideoHub Architecture - Component Diagram

actor User

rectangle "VideoHub System" {

  [Frontend\n(Next.js)] as FE
  [API Gateway\n(Express)] as GW
  [Auth Service] as AUTH
  [Video Service] as VS
  [Comment Service] as CS
  [Search Service] as SS
  [Notification Service] as NS
  [Data Access Layer\n(Prisma)] as DAL
  database "PostgreSQL" as DB

  () "IRestApi" as IRestApi
  () "IAuth" as IAuth
  () "IVideoOps" as IVideoOps
  () "ICommentOps" as ICommentOps
  () "ISearch" as ISearch
  () "ISearchIndex" as ISearchIndex
  () "INotify" as INotify
  () "IDataAccess" as IDataAccess

  GW - IRestApi
  AUTH - IAuth
  VS - IVideoOps
  CS - ICommentOps
  SS - ISearch
  SS - ISearchIndex
  NS - INotify
  DAL - IDataAccess
}

package "External Systems" {
  () "IGoogleOAuth" as IGoogleOAuth
  () "IEmailGateway" as IEmailGateway
  [Google OAuth] as GOOGLE
  [Email/SMS Gateway] as EMAIL
  GOOGLE - IGoogleOAuth
  EMAIL - IEmailGateway
}

User --> FE : uses
FE ..> IRestApi
GW ..> IAuth
GW ..> IVideoOps
GW ..> ICommentOps
GW ..> ISearch
VS ..> INotify
VS ..> ISearchIndex
AUTH ..> IDataAccess
VS ..> IDataAccess
CS ..> IDataAccess
SS ..> IDataAccess
DAL --> DB
AUTH ..> IGoogleOAuth
NS ..> IEmailGateway

@enduml
